rying":["Yeniden deneniyor"],"The connection dropped":["Ba\u011flant\u0131 koptu"],"We are retrying piece %s. Everything already sent is kept, so this carries on from where it stopped rather than starting again.":["%s numaral\u0131 par\u00e7a yeniden deneniyor. Zaten g\u00f6nderilen her \u015fey korundu, bu nedenle ba\u015ftan ba\u015flamak yerine kald\u0131\u011f\u0131 yerden devam ediyor."],"Attempt":["Deneme"],"Nothing has been lost. Your site is untouched and still serving visitors. If this keeps failing we will tell you exactly what to do next.":["Hi\u00e7bir \u015fey kaybolmad\u0131. Siteniz de\u011fi\u015fmedi ve ziyaret\u00e7ilere hizmet vermeye devam ediyor. Bu ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131z olmaya devam ederse, s\u0131rada ne yapman\u0131z gerekti\u011fini tam olarak size bildirece\u011fiz."],"retrying in %1$s second, attempt %2$s of %3$s":["%1$s saniye i\u00e7inde yeniden denenecek, %2$s\/%3$s deneme","%1$s saniye i\u00e7inde yeniden denenecek, %2$s\/%3$s deneme"],"retrying now, attempt %1$s of %2$s":["\u015fimdi yeniden deneniyor, %1$s\/%2$s deneme"],"Paused":["Duraklat\u0131ld\u0131"],"We have paused the move":["Ta\u015f\u0131ma i\u015flemini duraklatt\u0131k"],"We could not reach KapsuleHost after %1$s tries (%2$s). Nothing is lost. Everything already copied is still there, and this site has not been changed.":["%1$s denemeden sonra KapsuleHost'a ula\u015f\u0131lamad\u0131 (%2$s). Hi\u00e7bir \u015fey kaybolmad\u0131. Zaten kopyalanan her \u015fey h\u00e2l\u00e2 orada ve bu site de\u011fi\u015ftirilmedi."],"paused at %s":["%s konumunda duraklat\u0131ld\u0131"],"Check this server can reach the internet, then pick up where you left off. Nothing needs to be re-sent.":["Bu sunucunun internete ula\u015fabildi\u011fini kontrol edin, ard\u0131ndan kald\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z yerden devam edin. Hi\u00e7bir \u015feyin yeniden g\u00f6nderilmesine gerek yok."],"Pick up where it stopped":["Kald\u0131\u011f\u0131 yerden devam et"],"Copying your database":["Veritaban\u